# Data and planning apps

Five small apps handle records, forms, dates, tasks and files. They all have a ++PK?(Share++ tab with **Share & Chat**, and they all use the same three [layouts](#/layouts)!


::divider{wavy|Data and planning apps|cyan}
## Mainkey: records

@shimmer-3@Database@ [Open Mainkey](/mainkey)

Build your own fields, then keep records in them. Search, filter and sort in a **Table**, or browse a ++L5(Gallery++ with live statistics!

* #/O&Home& has New Record, Add Field, the Table and Gallery views, and Sort By!
* ++L5(Data++ imports and exports `.kb` files and exports `.csv`, and has Demo Data and Clear All!
* ;;PK;Share;; has a ++L}}Website Kit++ and ++Y~}Host++, which can serve the database straight from your browser tab so others can open it!

## Formly: forms

@gingham-4@Forms@ [Open Formly](/formly)

Build a form with ++B*}New Form++ and ++TU/)Add Field++, flip between ==C.Builder== and @foil-5@Preview@, and share it as a file:

* `.kfe` is an ++G(]editable++ form, so the other person can change it!
* `.kfv` is a **viewable** form that people fill in!
* `.kfa` holds the **answers**!

Question text accepts Keydown, so chips and highlights work in forms. Share & Chat lets a group edit a form together!

## Hexa: calendar and boards

++L!!Calendar++ [Open Hexa](/hexa)

* @gingham-5@Calendar@ shows months and an agenda for events. **Today** and ++B?Year++ jump around!
* ++TU/)Boards++ are columns of cards: **New Board**, **New Column** and @cloud-4@New Card@!
* ==C.Import and export== standard `.ics` files (so you can swap with other calendars) and Hexa's own `.kh` files!

## Taskra: to-do lists

++PK$Todo++ [Open Taskra](/taskra)

Tasks have priorities and due dates. Filter with ++R4}All Tasks++, ++TU$}Active++, **Done** and ++Y^)Overdue++, and use //GL~Clear Completed// to tidy up. Lists import and export as `.tk` files!

## Cabinet: drive

++C%%Drive++ [Open Cabinet](/cabinet)

Keep files in ++GL?)drawers++, like a file explorer. **New Drawer**, **New Folder** and ==GL~Upload Files== are on the Home tab, and @sprinkles-3@Cards@ or ++B/:List++ views are in View. A whole drive downloads at once as a ZIP, and the Share tab can save a drawer as a `.kc` or `.zip` file!
